  "_about": "GT3 race dash on the 1920x720 cluster, generated by design/gen_gt3.py (edit that and regenerate). Black covers BMW's gauges; while the Waze map shows inside the theme ('Show Waze map inside the theme', toggle 'mapUp'), 'hole' cuts the map window out of it over the map, inset 'holeInset' px with 'holeRadius' corners (tune in a copy pushed to <data>/layouts/gt3.json, scripts/deploy.sh). The background and every framed box are one effect layer ('boxes'); with the lights and one rev bar that is 3 effect layers, since the car draws only a few. Everything keeps 10 px clear of the hood's curve over the top corners and of the black box BMW draws at x 1406..1597, y 342..419. Widget reference: shared/hud.js header. M440i fit revision: vertical content region compressed above factory status bar, lower text fonts reduced, box positions recalculated; experimental, verify parked.",
